  "question": {
    "text": "\\(A B C\\) is an isosceles triangle with an inscribed circle with centre \\(O\\). Let \\(P\\) be the midpoint of \\(B C\\). If \\(A B=A C=15\\) and \\(B C=10\\), then \\(\\mathrm{OP}\\) equals",
